# AUB Admin Deploy (mandatory)

Any change in `AUB_admin` is not finished until it is on production. No exceptions: docs, PHP, JS, migrations, config in git — all go to the server in the same task.

- Production: `deploy@178.156.234.23:/var/www/aub`
- Domain: `https://aub.owlsolutions.net`
- After GitHub `git push origin main`, copy the changed files to `/var/www/aub` immediately.
- Production is a file tree, not a git repo. Do not `git pull` on the server. Do not init git there.
- Deploy only required files. Never upload Flutter apps, `.env`, `vendor`, `node_modules`, or storage runtime files. Never overwrite production `.env`.
- After file copy: `optimize:clear` when PHP/config/routes/views changed; `php artisan migrate --force` when schema changed; `npm run build` when frontend changed. Docs-only copy does not need migrate or npm build.
- Verify with HTTP checks and/or that the copied files exist on the server.
- Flutter (`AUB_app`) is a separate repo and is not deployed to `/var/www/aub`.
